message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Methanol Synthesis Reactor Digital Twin"
abstract: >-
  A research-grade Python implementation of an isothermal/cooled/adiabatic
  one-dimensional pseudo-homogeneous plug-flow reactor digital twin for
  industrial multi-tubular methanol synthesis on Cu/ZnO/Al2O3. Includes three
  published kinetic models (Graaf 1988, Vanden Bussche-Froment 1996, Nestler
  2020), Peng-Robinson and Soave-Redlich-Kwong fugacity corrections, Ergun
  pressure drop, Zehner-Schlunder bed transport, and a coupled energy balance
  with finite tube-to-shell heat transfer. Validated against 114 experimental
  data points from Park et al. (2014).
